# Revenue Recognition Policy

## Overview
This policy establishes the principles for recognizing revenue in accordance with ASC 606.

## Subscription Revenue

**Recognition:** Ratably over the subscription term
**Example:** $120K annual subscription = $10K per month

**Deferred Revenue:** Prepaid amounts recorded as liability until earned

## Professional Services Revenue

**Implementation Services:** Recognized upon completion of milestones
**Training Services:** Recognized upon delivery
**Consulting Services:** Recognized as services are performed (time and materials)

## Multi-Element Arrangements

When a contract includes multiple performance obligations (e.g., subscription + implementation), revenue is allocated based on standalone selling prices.

## Contract Modifications

Modifications are evaluated to determine if they create a new contract or are part of the existing contract.

